{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q161465","formula":"C₃H₅Br₂Cl","hill":"C3H5Br2Cl","elements":["H","C","Cl","Br"],"composition":{"C":3.0,"H":5.0,"Br":2.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"1,2-dibromo-3-chloropropane","ru":"1,2-Дибром-3-хлорпропан"},"descriptions":{"en":"1,2-Dibromo-3-chloropropane (dibromochloropropane), better known as DBCP, is the organic compound with the formula BrCH(CH2Br)(CH2Cl). It is a dense colorless liquid although commercial samples often appear amber or even brown. It is the active ingredient in the nematicide Nemagon, also known as Fumazone.","ru":"1,2-Дибром-3-хлорпропан (сокращённо ДБХП) — органическое соединение с химической формулой C3H5Br2Cl. Представляет собой бесцветную жидкость, хотя коммерческие образцы часто имеют янтарный или коричневый цвет. Является активным ингредиентом нематоцида Немагон, также известного как Фумазон."},"fame":18,"pubchemCid":7280,"mass":236.33,"charge":0,"smiles":"C(C(CBr)Br)Cl","inchikey":"WBEJYOJJBDISQU-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1,2-dibromo-3-chloropropane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"7280","atoms":11,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.792,"y":-1.501,"z":0.152,"el":"Br"},{"x":-2.595,"y":0.103,"z":-0.049,"el":"Br"},{"x":1.062,"y":1.828,"z":0.591,"el":"Cl"},{"x":0.166,"y":-0.581,"z":-0.463,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.935,"y":-0.717,"z":0.577,"el":"C"},{"x":0.51,"y":0.869,"z":-0.808,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.114,"y":-1.109,"z":-1.382,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.178,"y":-1.768,"z":0.767,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.694,"y":-0.246,"z":1.534,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.333,"y":1.4,"z":-1.257,"el":"H"},{"x":1.323,"y":0.9,"z":-1.541,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,3,1],[1,4,1],[2,5,1],[3,4,1],[3,5,1],[3,6,1],[4,7,1],[4,8,1],[5,9,1],[5,10,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q161465","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role"